</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/d64ccca0c6fbd18be5d4ec26e26efd89e9c0d76e" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:2.897ex; height:2.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbb {A} ^{n}}"/></span> obtained by removing the closed subset corresponding to the vanishing of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Discriminant" title="Discriminant" id="mwVg">discriminant</a>.</p>

<p id="mwVw">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fundamental_group" title="Fundamental group" id="mwWA">fundamental group</a> of the (topological) configuration space <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt39" id="mwWQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\operatorname{Conf}_n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \operatorname {Conf} _{n}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>Conf</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \operatorname {Conf} _{n}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/958de024ffad02dc66e622098238e757b7a4ecf0" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:6.063ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \operatorname {Conf} _{n}}"/></span> is the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artin_braid_group" title="Artin braid group" class="mw-redirect" id="mwWg">Artin braid group</a> <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt40" id="mwWw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"B_n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle B_{n}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>B</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle B_{n}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/2f568bf6d34e97b9fdda0dc7e276d6c4501d2045" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:2.982ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle B_{n}}"/></span>, generated by elementary braids <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt41" id="mwXA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\sigma_1, \\ldots, \\sigma_{n-1}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \sigma _{1},\ldots ,\sigma _{n-1}}">
