</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4880509ec5aba3483bfc301413d6f42ba3851eb4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:14.651ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \operatorname {Aut} (Y,p)\simeq G}"/></span>. Up to isomorphism, a <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt65" id="mwew" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"G"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle G}">
