<p id="mwfw">One may choose a generating set of the fundamental group <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt67" id="mwgA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\pi_1(\\mathbb{P}^1 \\smallsetminus \\mathbf{t},\\, \\infty)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \pi _{1}(\mathbb {P} ^{1}\smallsetminus \mathbf {t} ,\,\infty )}">
