<p id="mwpg">This topological space may be constructed as the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borel_construction" title="Borel construction" class="mw-redirect" id="mwpw">Borel construction</a> <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt101" id="mwqA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"G \\,\\backslash\\!\\!\\backslash\\, V_n \\,/\\!\\!/\\, B_n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle G\,\backslash \!\!\backslash \,V_{n}\,/\!\!/\,B_{n}}">
