<p id="mwuA">Using <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GAGA" title="GAGA" class="mw-redirect" id="mwuQ">GAGA</a> results, one shows that space is the analyfication of a complex scheme, and that scheme is shown to be obtained via <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Extension_of_scalars" title="Extension of scalars" class="mw-redirect" id="mwug">extension of scalars</a> of a <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt114" id="mwuw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\Z\\left[\\frac{1}{|G|}\\right]"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbb {Z} \left[{\frac {1}{|G|}}\right]}">
