</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/a601995d55609f2d9f5e233e36fbe9ea26011b3b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.395ex; height:1.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle n}"/></span> points.
The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Absolute_Galois_group" title="Absolute Galois group" id="mw1A">absolute Galois group</a> of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt135" id="mw1Q" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\Q"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbb {Q} }">
