</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/51701e439d3ecaf5265f344682de46e950b77b88" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:1.808ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\bar {\mathbb {Q} }}}"/></span>-points of the scheme <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt137" id="mw1w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathcal{H}_{G,n}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\mathcal {H}}_{G,n}}">
