</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/600e80bbe00b809c8524af72ff6f20c667f862f1" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:4.931ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\mathcal {H}}_{G,n}}"/></span>, and the fixed points of this action are precisely its <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt138" id="mw2A" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\Q"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbb {Q} }">
