        <mi>G</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle G}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f5f3c8921a3b352de45446a6789b104458c9f90b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.827ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle G}"/></span> is a centerless group, and fix a rigid list of rational conjugacy classes <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt156" id="mw8g" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathbf{c} = (c_1, \\ldots, c_n)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbf {c} =(c_{1},\ldots ,c_{n})}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mi mathvariant="bold">c</mi>
        </mrow>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>c</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mo>…<!-- … --></mo>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>c</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \mathbf {c} =(c_{1},\ldots ,c_{n})}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/0ff5f1b532a0080f0897a063f5bde607c38ade72" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:15.56ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbf {c} =(c_{1},\ldots ,c_{n})}"/></span>. Since the classes <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt157" id="mw8w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"c_1, \\ldots, c_n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle c_{1},\ldots ,c_{n}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>c</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mo>…<!-- … --></mo>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>c</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle c_{1},\ldots ,c_{n}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/22c1ec95175219801d58be5c63f155486225aa0d" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:9.465ex; height:2.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle c_{1},\ldots ,c_{n}}"/></span> are rational, the action of the absolute Galois group <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt158" id="mw9A" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"G_{\\Q}=\\operatorname{Gal}(\\bar\\Q\\mid\\Q)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle G_{\mathbb {Q} }=\operatorname {Gal} ({\bar {\mathbb {Q} }}\mid \mathbb {Q} )}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>G</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
              <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Q</mi>
            </mrow>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mi>Gal</mi>
        <mo>⁡<!-- ⁡ --></mo>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mover>
              <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Q</mi>
              </mrow>
              <mo stretchy="false">¯<!-- ¯ --></mo>
