  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/c5909f0b54e4718fa24d5fd34d54189d24a66e9a" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:1.808ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbb {Q} }"/></span> (for example, all points of the configuration are in <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt176" id="mwAQk" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathbf{A}^1(\\Q)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbf {A} ^{1}(\mathbb {Q} )}">
  <semantics>
